{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are stuck in a haunted mansion and desperately need to find the bathroom. Your goal: navigate the haunted halls and survive ghostly encounters to reach the porcelain promised land to escape before your bowels betray you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.poster.avif?t=1773359467\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.webm?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.mp4?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3193c62fa0f3972c424a61eb8cca1e20.avif?t=1773359467\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear, stress, and bad burritos all push your gut closer to disaster. Manage your bowels carefully - make better food choices, fart to relieve the pressure, and more, all before you become a pile of poo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.poster.avif?t=1773359467\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.webm?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.mp4?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/600e6d2ce7ff8e169a75ddae349cc0ee.avif?t=1773359467\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TP Mummies, turd mobs and a host of other horrors lurk in the darkness, waiting to scare your pants off. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.poster.avif?t=1773359467\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.webm?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.mp4?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e6b2d806d1d99e1a16a54fdc9be9702.avif?t=1773359467\" width=500 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up lanterns, wield wonky weapons, and fling fancy furniture to break open doors, solve haunted puzzles, and keep ghosts at bay (or just throw s#!t at your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.poster.avif?t=1773359467\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.webm?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.mp4?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/41c023f5d06a290f25101712642c9032.avif?t=1773359467\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge clothes from corpses to mix up your style. Then die, and return as a playable poop, only to be reborn again with an even better fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.poster.avif?t=1773359467\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.webm?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.mp4?t=1773359467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/d479e99f517fc814a7f4687a3adfabf1.avif?t=1773359467\" width=500 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The procedurally generated mansion won\u2019t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden,